<p>Inline math <span
class="math inline"><em>a</em><sup>2</sup> + <em>b</em><sup>2</sup> = <em>c</em><sup>2</sup></span>
appears mid-sentence.</p>
<p>Dollar-delimited math <span
class="math inline"><em>E</em> = <em>m</em><em>c</em><sup>2</sup></span>
also renders inline.</p>
<p>Display math is set apart:</p>
<p><span class="math display">$$
\int_0^1 x^2 \, dx = \frac{1}{3}
$$</span></p>
